<h3><u>Madine jau ya karbobala me reh jau</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Ae bhai hussaina..(8)<br />
Rehai paa ke jo zinda&#39;n se be watan aai..(2)<br />
Ye kehke gir gayi naaqe se roke chillai<br />
ke mere haal pe roti hai ab to tanhai<br />
salam karne ko aai hai teri maa jayi<br />
tu hi bataa...<br />
tu hi bata, mere bhaiyya kaha&#39;n sukoo&#39;n pau<br />
madine jaau ya karbobala mein reh jau..(3)</p>

<p>tu hi bata, mere bhaiyya kaha&#39;n sukoo&#39;n pau<br />
madine jaau ya karbobala mein reh jau</p>

<p>1. Sitam ne loot li ek din mein kayenaat meri<br />
na jaane kaise basar hogi ab hayaat meri<br />
na din sukoon se guzrega ab na raat meri<br />
kaha&#39;n hai laal mere jo sunenge baat meri<br />
tu hi bataa...</p>

<p>2. Mai tujhko chodke bhaiyya kahi na jaungi<br />
mai teri qabr ko apna watan banaungi<br />
mai ek choti si basti yahi&#39;n basaungi<br />
mai zaereen ko paani yehi pilaungi<br />
tu hi bataa...</p>

<p>3. Akeli reh gayi atthara bhaiyo ki bahan<br />
jo hota ghazi to banti na bazuo mein rasan<br />
batau kya ke jo puchenge mujhse ehle watan<br />
hussain ko diya tumne batao kaise kafan<br />
tu hi bataa...</p>

<p>4. Na koi mera yaha&#39;n hai na koi mera waha&#39;n<br />
sakina shaam mein hai dafn aur tu hai yaha&#39;n<br />
kaha&#39;n kaha&#39;n kise royegi ab meri amma<br />
na hoga ab kabhi abaad fatema ka maka&#39;n<br />
tu hi bataa...</p>

<p>5. Yaha&#39;n hai asghare besheer aur waha&#39;n jhula<br />
yaha&#39;n pe auno mohammad waha&#39;n pe abdullah<br />
jo pucha bacho ko unse mai kahungi kya<br />
madina dil hai mera rooh meri karbobala<br />
tu hi bataa...</p>

<p>6. Yaha&#39;n hai qasim e khasta badan waha&#39;n kubra<br />
yaha&#39;n shabihe payambar waha&#39;n pe hai sughra<br />
waha&#39;n pe fazl akela yaha&#39;n pe sab kunba<br />
jawab kitne sawalo&#39;n ka dungi mai tanha<br />
tu hi bataa...</p>

<p>7. Ye haath jodke kehti hai teri maa jayi<br />
duaein dengi mere bhai meri tanhai<br />
bus ek din ko mere saath chal mere bhai<br />
lagega jaise madine mein fir bahaar aayi<br />
tu hi bataa...</p>

<p>8. Lo jaa rahi hai bahan alwida mere bhai<br />
rahi jo zinda to phir aayegi ye maa jayi<br />
raza ye sunte hi qabr e hussain tharrayi<br />
phir iske baad kabhi ye sada nahi aayi<br />
tu hi bataa...</p>
</p>
